    <guid isPermaLink="false">671126210d2f24f289e64ae3</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 17 Oct 2024 22:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a></span></strong><span> - 介绍本期节目主题：国内视频网站视频压缩现象。</span><br><span></span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="27">00:27</a></span></strong><span> - 码率概念解析码率与视频清晰度的关系。在同等分辨率下，码率越高，视频清晰度越高。</span><br><span></span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="62">01:02</a></span></strong><span> - 国内外视频码率对比比较国内外视频网站的码率差异，国外视频网站的码率明显高于国内。</span><br><span></span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="143">02:23</a></span></strong><span> - 视频网站的成本考量讨论视频网站为何降低码率：成本控制和带宽成本问题。</span><br><span></span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="245">04:05</a></span></strong><span> - 带宽成本与视频平台带宽成本在视频平台运营中的重要性，以及微信朋友圈视频长度限制的背后原因。</span><br><span></span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="405">06:45</a></span></strong><span> - 国内外网络环境差异讨论国内外网络环境差异及其对视频平台的影响。</span><br><span></span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="786">13:06</a></span></strong><span> - 运营商与内容提供商的权力对比讨论国内外运营商与内容提供商之间的权力关系。</span><br><span></span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="864">14:24</a></span></strong><span> - 谷歌的暗光纤策略谷歌如何通过购买暗光纤降低YouTube的带宽成本。</span><br><span></span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1140">19:00</a></span></strong><span> - 中国视频平台的挑战中国视频平台面临的带宽成本和流量商压力。</span><br><span></span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1311">21:51</a></span></strong><span> - 影视飓风视频下架讨论分析影视飓风视频下架的原因，以及其对行业的潜在影响。</span><br><span></span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><br><span></span></p>]]></description>
